KernelFactory_constructor
├── when uups implementation has no code
│   └── it should revert with ImplementationNotDeployed
├── when immutableEcdsa implementation has no code
│   └── it should revert with ImplementationNotDeployed
└── when both implementations are deployed
    ├── it should set the UUPS immutable
    └── it should set the IMMUTABLE_ECDSA immutable
